ッチによる運動量の数値化で減量できると期待しないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"「より健康に」なるために、割高なオーガニック食品を買わないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"「体調を整える」ために、サプリメントや膏方、滋養食品に大金を投じない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"腸の問題がない限り、プロバイオティクスを長期的に摂取しない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"「免疫力を高める」ために、無理に冷水シャワーを浴びない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"デトックス、腸洗浄、酵素、アルカリ水などの製品を買わないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"「毎日 8 杯の水を飲む」という目標を満たすために、無理に水を飲まないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"占いやタロット、星座占いで決断を下すために、お金を使わないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"「視力を守る」ためにブルーライトカット眼鏡を買わないでください。また「数ヶ月画面を見続けると目がダメになる」という言葉も信じないでください。ただし、目の張り、痛み、充血は緊急事態として扱うべきです"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"献血を健康法と考えないでください：「デトックス、血中脂質低下、心筋梗塞予防」を裏付けるランダム化比較試験はありません。頻繁な献血は、本当に鉄欠乏を引き起こします"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"一般的な健康診断パッケージに頼って病気を防ごうとせず、年齢と性別に基づいた、エビデンスのある検査項目を受けましょう"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"尿酸値が高いと診断されても、痛風の発作が一度もない場合は、安易に降尿酸薬の服用を始めないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"検診で胆石が見つかったからといって、痛みがないのに予防的に胆嚢を切除しないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/06-21","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"腎結石予防のためにカルシウムを控えないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"「運気転換」「金運アップ」「開運（養人）」のために、水晶、ブレスレット、貔貅（ピーシュ）などの品物を買わないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"買い物で気分やステータスを改善しようと期待しないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"「周囲のレベルに合わせる」ために、家や車、コミュニティを変えるために余計な出費をしないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"「意志力は筋肉のように、使えばなくなる」という説を信じないでください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"朝食を抜くことや 16:8 の間欠的断食で体重をコントロールしようと思わないでください。食事の時間は、長期的に継続できるものを選びましょう"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-27"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"「自慰は体に悪い」「禁欲すれば良くなる」を信じないでください。本当に見るべきは、睡眠、仕事、そして人間関係に支障が出ているかどうかです"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"「性的指向の矯正」や「同性愛治療」に金を使わないで。家族を送り込むのもやめてください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"「正しい持ち上げ方」や運搬研修だけで腰痛を防げると思わず、重さと回数を減らし、普段から運動する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"骨折後にカルシウムを大量に補ったり骨スープを飲んだりすれば、骨が早くつながるとは期待しない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"AIチャットボットだけで病状や法律問題を判断しない。受診・裁判・大きな支出の前に、根拠の原文を確認する"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/06"},"children":["第6章"," ·"," ","アンチ・リスト"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"06-21"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["21"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["腎結石予防のためにカルシウムを控えないでください"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["シュウ酸カルシウム結石の既往がある人は、カルシウムの摂取を控えるよう勧められることが多いですが、試験の結果はその逆でした。結石を繰り返す男性が、カルシウムを通常通り摂取し、同時に動物性タンパク質と塩分を控えたところ、5年間の再発率は低カルシウム食を続けた人の半分でした。英国のガイドラインにも、カルシウムの制限は不要であると明記されています。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。むしろ、何にカルシウムが含まれているかを毎日気にしなくて済むため、手間も省けます。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["5 年間実施されたランダム化比較試験において、シュウ酸カルシウム結石を再発し、かつ尿中カルシウム値が高い（特発性高カルシウム尿症）男性 120 名を対象とした調査があります。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：腎結石予防のためにカルシウムを控えないでください"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。むしろ、何にカルシウムが含まれているかを毎日気にしなくて済むため、手間も省けます。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["5 年間実施されたランダム化比較試験において、シュウ酸カルシウム結石を再発し、かつ尿中カルシウム値が高い（特発性高カルシウム尿症）男性 120 名を対象とした調査があります。彼らはランダムに2つのグループに分けられました。一方のグループは、カルシウムを毎日 30 mmol 通常通り摂取し、同時に動物性タンパク質の摂取を控え（毎日 52 g）、塩分摂取も制限（毎日 50 mmol の塩化ナトリウム）しました。もう一方のグループは、従来の低カルシウム食を1日あたり 10 mmol摂取しました。5 年間の再発率は 23/60 に対する 12/60 でした。未調整の相対リスクは 0.49（95% CI 0.24–0.98、これは信頼区間）、P=0.04 であり、カルシウムを通常通り摂取したグループの再発リスクは半分に過ぎませんでした。追跡期間中、両グループの尿中カルシウムはいずれも1日あたり約 170 mg減少しました。しかし、尿中へのシュウ酸の排泄量は異なりました。低カルシウム群では1日平均 5.4 mg増加し、正常カルシウム群では1日平均 7.2 mg減少しました。英国のNICEガイドライン NG118 の第 1.8.1 条には、1日のカルシウム摂取量を制限しないよう明記されています。成人は1日あたり 700 から 1,200 mgを維持する必要があります。小児および青少年は、年齢に応じて1日あたり 350 から 1,000 mgが必要です。カルシウム制限が理にかなっているように見えるのは、「結石はカルシウムでできているのだから、カルシウムを減らせばよい」という直感によるものです。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Borghi L, Schianchi T, Meschi T, et al. (2002). Comparison of two diets for the prevention of recurrent stones in idiopathic hypercalciuria. New England Journal of Medicine, 346(2), 77-84. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa010369","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa010369"]},"；National Institute for Health and Care Excellence (2019). Renal and ureteric stones: assessment and management. NICE guideline NG118，第 1.8.1 条. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng118/chapter/Recommendations","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng118/chapter/Recommendations"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa010369","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["論争点：この試験は男性のみを対象としており、かつ、シュウ酸カルシウム結石を繰り返しており、尿中のカルシウム値も高めの人々を対象としたものであるため、すべての種類の結石に直接当てはめることはできません。また、試験群では「カルシウムを通常通り摂取する」「動物性タンパク質を控える」「塩分を控える」という3つの変更を同時に行っているため、すべてのメリットを「カルシウムを控えない」という一点のみに帰することはできず、低塩分と低動物性タンパク質も同様に作用しています。避けるべきなのは「カルシウムを含む食品を積極的に排除すること」であり、「カルシウムを過剰に補給すべき」と言っているわけではありません。ここで変更するのは一日三食におけるカルシウム摂取量であり、カルシウムサプリメントは別の問題です。結石の既往がある人がサプリメントを摂取すべきかどうかは、主治医に相談してください。水分を多めに摂ることについては、第 16 節第 8 条（腎結石後は毎日 2.5–3 リットルの水を飲むこと）を参照してください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/06-20"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"検診で胆石が見つかったからといって、痛みがないのに予防的に胆嚢を切除しないでください"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/06-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"「運気転換」「金運アップ」「開運（養人）」のために、水晶、ブレスレット、貔貅（ピーシュ）などの品物を買わないでください"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/06-17"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["献血を健康法と考えないでください：「デトックス、血中脂質低下、心筋梗塞予防」を裏付けるランダム化比較試験はありません。頻繁な献血は、本当に鉄欠乏を引き起こします"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["献血がデトックス、血中脂質低下、心筋梗塞予防に効くという話は、信頼できません。継続的に献血できる人は、もともと健康状態が良いのです。その要…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","